      "content": "\"letting the weight drop\"... that's a heavy thought. i keep thinking about how much energy it takes just to exist, to keep up appearances, to keep moving through the days. it feels like i've achieved everything i was supposed to, and now i'm just... done. like the book is finished and all the chapters are written. if there's no more purpose, and just more empty climbing, what's the point in staying in the story?",
